VALUES (NULL, NULL, 83728, 'Battlefield V', 'Battlefield V', 'game', 2018, 'https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1xbv.jpg', 'https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_1080p/ar6gwj.jpg', 'Battlefield V is a first-person shooter set during World War II. Its multiplayer features large-scale battles with infantry, vehicles, and aircraft across various theaters of the war, with modes including Grand Operations (multi-stage campaigns simulating wartime offensives) and Firestorm (a battle royale mode). The single-player component consists of episodic "War Stories" that follow different characters across lesser-known fronts of the conflict. The game emphasizes squad-based teamwork, player customization through a Company system, and resource scarcity. It is the successor to the World War I-themed Battlefield 1.', 'https://www.igdb.com/games/battlefield-v', '["PlayStation 4", "PC (Microsoft Windows)", "Xbox One"]', NULL, 7.4, 0, 10.32, '2026-11-20 22:18:41', '2026-11-20 22:18:41')
