VALUES (NULL, NULL, 27344, 'Barotrauma', 'Barotrauma', 'game', 2023, 'https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/coa97f.jpg', 'https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_1080p/ar5cc.jpg', 'Barotrauma is a 2D online multiplayer game taking place in a submarine travelling through the icy depths of Jupiter’s moon Europa. The bone-crushing pressure outside the submarine, the strange creatures inhabiting the ocean and the potentially dangerous equipment and machines on board ensure that the tiniest slip can turn the game into a chaotic struggle for survival.

The game is heavily inspired by Space Station 13 and a game concept called Pressure.', 'https://www.igdb.com/games/barotrauma', '["Linux", "PC (Microsoft Windows)", "Mac"]', NULL, 7.3, 0, 12.35, '2026-11-19 20:56:22', '2026-11-20 22:18:41')
